    "inputHash": "sha256:5f4ac749f6c1b81aa6b6f35857ddf10a86a344f2aa6465a048508ec3322c6d70",
    "notes": "The Centre Pompidou exterior retains the exposed white frame, six rises of the west escalator, red stair towers and color-coded services. Its paved piazza descends to the recessed Forum entrance. The Forum threshold height and the joins across the ends of the piazza are reconstructed from the museum description, photographs and standard terrain. The site fit is a visual approximation. The glazing uses an opaque reflective material. The model depicts the established exterior and entrance with simplified plant and vestibule geometry."
  },
